{
  "sequence_id": "seq_d8afceb0e8f9122d",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hey Mongirl! I'll give ya 100 yen if ya eat this cigarette."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "MANGA STREAN, DO NOT NIRROR"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Really?!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Bot- Tom's up!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Gaha haha haha ha!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SPX: GULP"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If another devil shows up, we'll call you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Try to run and you'll be sleeping with the fishes."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "MAN GA STREAMLAD: Don't mirror"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "This'll cover another 3 days of food!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The other day I heard,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "that people normally eat bread with jam spread all over it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Well, normally's just a dream for us though."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Just R us"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I doubt I'll pay off this debt before I die."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "...I'm gonna die single aren't I?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Not like I could bring a girl back to this shitshack. Don't have the cash to be Latin' either."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "whimper"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If I could get any wish granted, I'd wanna be with a girl before I die..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "LANGAS SIRLAN: Do not mirror"
    }
  ],
